# PluginServerOptions Configuration

## Namespace
`Cyrena.Extensa.Options`

## Purpose
Configuration for plugin server integration including default servers and HTTP client settings.

## Properties

### DefaultServers
```csharp
public List<DefaultServer> DefaultServers { get; set; } = [];
```
Servers initialized on startup. Useful for official/built-in plugin repositories.

### TimeoutSeconds
```csharp
public int TimeoutSeconds { get; set; } = 30;
```
HTTP request timeout in seconds. Default is 30.

### EnableRetry
```csharp
public bool EnableRetry { get; set; } = true;
```
Enable automatic retry on transient failures.

### MaxRetries
```csharp
public int MaxRetries { get; set; } = 3;
```
Maximum number of retry attempts.

## DefaultServer Configuration

```csharp
public class DefaultServer
{
    public required string Id { get; set; }
    public required string Name { get; set; }
    public required string BaseUrl { get; set; }
    public string? ApplicationId { get; set; }
    public int Priority { get; set; }
}
```

## Registration

```csharp
// Via delegate
services.AddPluginServerServices(options =>
{
    options.DefaultServers = new[]
    {
        new DefaultServer
        {
            Id = "official",
            Name = "Official Plugins",
            BaseUrl = "https://plugins.example.com/",
            ApplicationId = "my-app",
            Priority = 0
        }
    };
    options.TimeoutSeconds = 60;
});

// Via instance
services.AddPluginServerServices(new PluginServerOptions
{
    DefaultServers = defaultServersList
});
```

